window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Hell’s royals have risen. The world teeters on the edge of destruction. And I’ve just found my real purpose in all this. There are seven Princes of Hell and seven Vindix—chosen warriors—to defeat them.</p> <p>As a seeker witch, my job is to find the other Vindix.</p> <p>Easy right?</p> <p>Not quite.</p> <p>Putting aside the aforementioned royals, the Ordo Aeternum has it out for me, and the Ringmaster has revealed herself to be more dangerous than ever.</p> <p>My enemies are powerful, but my loved ones are too.</p> <p>Especially Tobias, a vampire, my fated mate.</p> <p>Who knew?</p> <p>Not me, but I'm thanking the goddess for them because I’ll need every helping hand I can get, and a whole lot of luck, to find the other Vindix before the Princes of Hell take over our world.</p>"; 
